You tessellate your cloak with small pieces of metal, providing [22, 30, 36, 41, 46 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] damage reduction against all attacks.

The myriad metal scraps also help against incoming projectiles, providing a [32%, 35%, 38%, 40%, 41% (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] chance of deflecting them to a nearby spot.
